  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"/unavailable-source?title=Special%3AFilePath%2FRed%20Gift.png\" title=\"Red Gift\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Red Gift\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Red Gift</figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\"><a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Product</a></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e1/Experience.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160312141717\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> Exp. lvl(s) 25</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>holly</span><span title=\"Holly\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"holly\"><img alt=\"holly\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/b/b8/Holly.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20221206145759\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>25</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>time</span><span title=\"Production/Building time\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"time\"><img alt=\"time\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/35/Clock.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160228103426\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>  45m</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Source </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>Gift Wrapping Station</span><span title=\"Gift Wrapping Station\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/gift-wrapping-station-35675\" title=\"Gift Wrapping Station\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Gift Wrapping Station\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color pi-collapse pi-collapse-closed\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">+</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Also: </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 3</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/masteries-6459\" title=\"Masteries\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">★★★</a> </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">39m</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Red Gift</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">product</a> unlocked at <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> level 25. It's a special item used only for the Christmas 2023 event.\n</p><p>The Red Gift returns as a special item for the Christmas 2024 event, but with a different appearance and requires different items to create it in the Gift Wrapping Station.\n</p><p>Like all <a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">products</a>, it is stored in the <a href=\"/wiki/barn-2652\" title=\"Barn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">barn</a>.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Appearance</b></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\">2023</span></h3>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ARed_Gift.png\" title=\"Red Gift.png (199 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/0/04/Red_Gift.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20231217105303\" title=\"Red Gift.png (199 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Red Gift in 2023\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Red Gift.png (199 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Red Gift in 2023\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\">Red Gift in 2023</div></div></div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\">2024</span></h3>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ARed_Gift_2024.png\" title=\"Red Gift 2024.png (172 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/fc/Red_Gift_2024.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20250427234935\" title=\"Red Gift 2024.png (172 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Red Gift in 2024\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Red Gift 2024.png (172 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Red Gift in 2024\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\">Red Gift in 2024</div></div></div>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Making Red Gifts</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"/unavailable-source?title=Special%3AFilePath%2FGift%20Wrapping%20Station%202023.png\" title=\"Gift Wrapping Station\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Gift Wrapping Station\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Gift Wrapping Station</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Red Gifts are made in the <a href=\"/wiki/gift-wrapping-station-35675\" title=\"Gift Wrapping Station\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Gift Wrapping Station</a>.\n</p><p>To make a red gift in the Christmas 2023 event, players need the following ingredients, in the specified quantities:\n</p>\n<table>\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/wooly-chaps-14259\" title=\"Wooly Chaps\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Wooly Chaps\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/apple-2241\" title=\"Apple\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Apple\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/cotton-14254\" title=\"Cotton\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Cotton\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>x1</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>x3</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>x3</b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>It takes 45 minutes to make one gift, and 39 minutes in a fully <a href=\"/wiki/masteries-6459\" title=\"Masteries\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">mastered</a> station. Each gift gives players 68 <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> points.\n</p><p>To make a red gift in the Christmas 2024 event, players need the following ingredients, in the specified quantities:\n</p>\n<table>\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/chocolate-cake-2323\" title=\"Chocolate Cake\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chocolate Cake\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/coffee-bean-2423\" title=\"Coffee Bean\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Coffee Bean\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/chamomile-36216\" title=\"Chamomile\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chamomile\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"57\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>x1</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>x3</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>x5</b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>It takes 10 minutes to make one gift, and 8 minutes in a fully <a href=\"/wiki/masteries-6459\" title=\"Masteries\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">mastered</a> station. Each gift gives players 122 <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> points.\n</p><p>To make a red gift in the <b>Christmas 2025 event</b>, players need the following ingredients, in the specified quantities:\n</p>\n<table>\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/icy-gift-36481\" title=\"Icy Gift\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Icy Gift\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"67\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/violet-dress-14260\" title=\"Violet Dress\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Violet Dress\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>x1</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>x1</b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>It takes 10 minutes to make a gift. Each treat gives players 173 experience points.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Boat orders</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/2/2c/Riverboat.png/revision/latest?cb=20150712182459\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Riverboat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Riverboat\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Riverboat</figcaption></figure>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/boat-2675\" title=\"Boat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Boat</a> orders ask for 1 gift per crate, up to a total of 4 per boat. Each gift used on a boat will be rewarded with 25 <a href=\"/wiki/holly-35688\" title=\"Holly\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">holly</a>.</li></ul>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<p><br>\n</p>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"navtitle\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/category%2Fcategory-gift-wrapping-station-products-35683\" title=\"Category:Gift Wrapping Station Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Gift Wrapping Station Products</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/green-gift-35678\" title=\"Green Gift\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Green Gift\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/long-gift-35680\" title=\"Long Gift\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Long Gift\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/snowflake-gift-35674\" title=\"Snowflake Gift\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Snowflake Gift\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/stacked-gift-35679\" title=\"Stacked Gift\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Stacked Gift\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/choo-choo-gift-36001\" title=\"Choo Choo Gift\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Choo Choo Gift\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/red-gift-35999\" title=\"Red Gift\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Red Gift\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/round-gift-35998\" title=\"Round Gift\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Round Gift\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/yellow-gift-36000\" title=\"Yellow Gift\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Yellow Gift\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"navtitle\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Products</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260901030928\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.105 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.129 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1017/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 4794/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 784/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 7/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3239/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/200\nLua time usage: 0.012/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 765911/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   84.088      1 -total\n 71.99%   60.537      1 Template:Infobox\n 28.67%   24.105      5 Template:Infoicon\n 16.81%   14.139      1 Template:Navigation\n  8.57%    7.206      1 Template:GiftWrappingStationMenu\n  2.00%    1.680      1 Template:Languages\n  1.98%    1.665      4 Template:Clr\n  1.68%    1.410      1 Template:PageDisplay\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_hayday:pcache:idhash:35999-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260901030928 and revision id 108959. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
